    "text": "Launch! A SpaceX Falcon 9 rocket has launched the USSF-317 classified mission for the United States Space Force from Vandenberg Space Force Base in California tonight.\n\nThe booster for this flight was B1💯 (IYKYK) on its 11th flight, and the launch was SpaceX’s 128th mission of 2026.",
