    "text": "Can one astronaut inspire a generation? 👩‍🚀✨\n\nAlmost 9 in 10 Europeans believe that sending astronauts from their own country into space can inspire young people to pursue science and technology.\n\nThat’s why we’re boosting European space exploration. 🚀",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/esa.int/post/3n2qrktbfls2b",
