    "text": "Several hours after Ship 44 went out to Massey's for cryo testing, Booster 24 looks set to join the party. It's heading out toward Highway 4 in advance of a road delay that starts in 10 minutes.\n\nnsf.live/starbase",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3n2pvbmrxuc25",
