    "text": "Our Hera mission is now studying asteroid Didymos from just 28.5 km away in visible light and infrared to reveal its surface features, composition and temperature. ☄️\n\nThese observations will help us better understand asteroid properties and improve planetary defence.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/esa.int/post/3n2iriadbvk26",
