    "text": "Our planetary defence mission Hera is about to reveal the first detailed images of asteroid Dimorphos since NASA’s DART impact in 2022.\n\n🗓️ Journalists, join our media briefing on 25 November, in Berlin or online.\n\nRegister by 23 November: blogs.esa.int/forms/esa-me...",
